st suit your play style. This will make your climb up the corporate ladder much more fun (and violent). <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408680/extras/818488bdfc14d80b2113da9d699194a7.avif?t=1674064902\" width=600 height=78 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408680/extras/56d65a7883a3d72553b9d8dbaeef05c2.poster.avif?t=1674064902\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408680/extras/56d65a7883a3d72553b9d8dbaeef05c2.webm?t=1674064902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408680/extras/56d65a7883a3d72553b9d8dbaeef05c2.mp4?t=1674064902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From the streets of Old New York to the deserts of Varmstaad and building complexes of the Huxwell Clinic, you’ll have beautiful vistas to admire. Also, you will be shot at, so you'd better not admire the scenery too much. Worry not, the shifts are brief, and you will get a chance to go again at short notice. #LearningOpportunities<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb the corporate ladder from Junior to Master Mercenary levels <br></li><li>Nine player matches, with three teams of three mercs going against each other  <br></li><li>Three unique maps with five different game modes <br></li><li>Customizable and upgradeable weapons and loadouts <br></li><li>Various tools and gadgets to give you an edge over the competition </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our community</h2>Share your feedback and discuss with the devs on our Discord channel:<br>", "short_description": "Nine to Five is a Team-Based Multiplayer FPS, where you outsmart the competition. Unlock corporation-sponsored gear, customize